	(text "1.2 V core from 5V_SYS through a 2 A buck; 1.2 V analog and 3.3 V analog through 0R (or ferrite)\nfilters as in GS2971A figure 5-1.  3.3 V I/O and analog from the relay's 3V3_IO.  About 0.8 W."
